/-! ## 1. evalReal identity: certificate expression = deltaX at the box
coordinates

Tactic body VERBATIM from the in-tree T11Glue identity (private there,
`eval_C2125338128M`, T11Glue.lean:54-59 — this module owns its copy;
the identity is already proven in-tree, so the semantics anchor is
doubly owned).  NOTE: unlike P1/P2 (y-space Base boxes, squared in the
bridge), this family's Base box is already x-space, so the identity is
the DIRECT `deltaX` form and the bridge needs no squaring step. -/

private theorem evalReal_eq_deltaX (ρ : Fin 6 → ℝ) :
    (C2125338128MExpr).evalReal ρ
